From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herrie <Github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:52:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] com.webos.app.test.webosose: use the media.operation ACG

'media' is a legacy access control group name; umediaserver declares
media.operation, media.query and media.devutility, so the requested
group does not exist:

WARNING: luneos-dev-image-1.0-r0 do_validate_ls2_acg: Found 17 group(s) used in client-permissions.d but not defined
'media' being used in:
  com.webos.app.test.webosose.app.json

Ask for media.operation instead, which is what com.webos.media exposes
its playback APIs under.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 appinfo.json | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/appinfo.json b/appinfo.json
index 4553835..3675a5c 100644
--- a/appinfo.json
+++ b/appinfo.json
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
 	"iconColor":"#E42E28",
 	"disallowScrollingInMainFrame": false,
 	"requiredPermissions": [
-		"media"
+		"media.operation"
 	],
 	"uiRevision": 2
 }
\ No newline at end of file
